# No Git

Never handle anything git-related in this project.

## Do not

- Run git commands (`git status`, `git diff`, `git add`, `git commit`, `git push`, `git pull`, `git checkout`, `git branch`, `git merge`, `git rebase`, `git worktree`, etc.)
- Create, amend, or suggest commits
- Create or update pull requests / use `gh` for git workflow
- Create or manage branches or worktrees
- Offer git finish/merge/PR/discard menus or ask about committing

## Do

- Implement and verify code changes only
- Leave all version control to the user
- If a skill or plan step says to commit, push, PR, or manage branches — skip that step
